docs/plans/125_planning_integrity_loop.md: Plan #125 is Complete and describes the Planning Integrity contract (plan admission, epistemic frontier, reassessment). Admitting one additional agent class to SUPPORTED_AGENTS changes neither that contract nor any of its templates, so the plan's normative design remains accurate as written.
docs/reference/CONFIG_REFERENCE.md: SUPPORTED_AGENTS is a code constant, not a meta-process.yaml key. The config reference documents configuration surfaces and their defaults; it does not enumerate agent classes, so there is nothing in it made stale by this change.
